.DS_Store
*.DS_Store
.env
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
node_modules/
docs/oida-core/
corpora/*/slices/

# Fresh Phase-4 corpus GOLD stays private until the pre-registered run (P4-S2).
# Public (committed): corpus.jsonl + queries.jsonl + README.md + FREEZE.json (hashes only).
# Gold (never committed): qrels relevance judgments + the local builder that embeds
# them. Full gold also lives in experiments/annotations/ (ignored below).
corpora/anchor-oida-history/qrels/
corpora/anchor-oida-history/_build_pilot.py

# Internal experiment harness — narrow-tracked from 2026-06-01 (P0-prep).
# Track ONLY scripts/ + adapters/ + the nested .gitignore + the Regression
# Evidence-Bundle dir experiments/output/regression/; everything else under
# experiments/ stays OFF git (gold answer-key, run artifacts, working notes).
#
# P0-S7 (2026-06-03): regression/ is now trackable. ORDER MATTERS in gitignore —
# a parent dir must be RE-INCLUDED before a deny rule can re-ignore its contents,
# and the child re-include must come AFTER that re-ignore. So:
#   experiments/output/        -> re-include the output dir itself
#   experiments/output/*       -> re-ignore everything inside it (runs, cache, ...)
#   experiments/output/regression/ -> re-include just the Evidence-Bundle subtree
# Gold (experiments/annotations/) stays ignored FOREVER below — never re-included.
experiments/*
!experiments/scripts/
!experiments/adapters/
!experiments/.gitignore
!experiments/output/
experiments/output/*
!experiments/output/regression/
experiments/annotations/
experiments/systems/
experiments/runs/
experiments/reports/
experiments/*.md
# Pre-registration plans ARE committed (their integrity = a timestamped, immutable
# commitment before the run; "Evidence: the committed plan diff" — roadmap P4-S2).
# Methodology only (no gold/answer-key). Re-included AFTER the experiments/*.md deny.
!experiments/EXPERIMENT_PLAN_v2.md
/scripts/
tobefixed/
